rrified to see what's become of  the world around him little girl  I'm a policeman  little girl  Rick is saved by his ability to find  Community with others then nearly lose  them again and again due to hardship  hostile forces or his own ego at one  point with hope for the future at an  all-time low he declares that we are The  Walking Dead  with the final one year later sequence  in rest in peace one of the series most  shocking turns is the promise of a  challenging future but also an  underlying sense of hope I want to talk  about the future there's a lot out there  to find out about and I think it's time  we did it's wild to watch a series Once  mired in its own Bleak Outlook morph  into something optimistic but that's  exactly where the series finale leaves  us  thank you

